{
    "title": "Frisbee: Rewards for Receipts",
    "description": "*The best cash back app of 2023!\r\n\r\nIntroducing Frisbee, earn cash back while shopping smarter, and saving more money on everything you need. From groceries to online shopping to  everyday essentials like Tide detergent and Huggies diapers, Frisbee makes it easy to get cash back on all your purchases.\r\n\r\nUsing Frisbee is Simple\r\n1. Start Shopping- Online or in-store, groceries, retailers, or restaurants it\u2019s up to you\r\n2. Take pictures of your receipts to earn points\r\n3. Redeem your points for cash, gift cards, and more!\r\n4. Maximize your earnings with bonus offers\r\n\r\nScan Receipts to Earn Big\r\nFrisbee rewards you for both physical and e-receipts, so you always have a chance to earn cash or gift cards.\r\n\r\nShop at your favorite retailers including:\r\nAmazon\r\nWalmart\r\nSam\u2019s Club\r\nUberEats\r\nTarget\r\nBest Buy\r\nMacy's\r\nSephora\r\nAdidas\r\nNike\r\nAnd many more!\r\n\r\nHundreds of rewards to choose from!\r\nCash out your points with gift cards from popular brands like Amazon and Starbucks. You can also use your points towards sweepstakes, where you\u2019ll have a chance to earn BIG.\r\n\r\nEnter Daily Sweepstakes \r\nUse the points earned through shopping to enter our daily sweepstakes for a daily chance to win extra cash. That\u2019s 365 chances a year to win \u2013 you got this! Here\u2019s how it works\u2026\r\n\r\nDaily Sweeps: Frisbee users who submit a picture of 1 receipt (only scanned receipts) will be entered for a chance to win 2,000 points ($10). That's up to $3,600 a year!\r\n\r\nWeekly Sweepstakes: Frisbee users who submit a receipt scan or have loyalty linked accounts will be eligible to enter our weekly sweepstakes where 2 winners will be chosen each week to win 25,000 points each ($125).\r\n\r\nJoin the movement\r\nMillions of people are saving, earning, and staying ahead of inflation.\r\nDitch the promo codes and old paper coupons and shop with Frisbee to earn real cash back.\r\n\r\nDownload the Frisbee app now to start earning cash back on every purchase, enter sweepstakes,  and watch your savings grow",
